{"abstract":[{"text":"Some components can be used for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"actions","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Actions","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"Actions","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}]},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/actions"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"text":"Buttons","anchor":"Buttons","type":"heading"},{"tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_BlueCoat"}]}],"title":"BlueCoat"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_FoxyRough","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"FoxyRough"}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOButton","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" proposes layout with text only, icon only or text and icon.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Four hierarchies are proposed for all layouts: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"strong"}]},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"minimal"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"negative","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Two style are available: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"loading","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If button is placed on colored surface using ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the default colors (content, background and border) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrom."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A button with ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOButton.Appearance.Negative","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Two sizes are available: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Icon only with default appearance","    MISOButton(image: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\", appearance: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text only with negative appearance","    MISOButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative, size: .small) {}","    ","    \/\/ The same button (text only) with loading style (indeterminate process)","    MISOButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading(), size: .small) {}","    ","    \/\/ The same button (text only) with loading style (progress at 75 %)","    MISOButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading(progress: 0.75), size: .small) {}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For accessibility reasons, if the user in the system settings toggles the option to reduce the animations, the loading indicator will be frozen to be more comfortable for the user."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For ecodesign reasons, if the user toggles the low power mode, the loading indicator will be frozen to prevent the CPU to work and waste energy."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"component_button_BlueCoat":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/component_button_BlueCoat.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A button component in light and dark modes with BlueCoat theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_button_BlueCoat"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOButton":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOButton"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOButton"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobutton","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOButton","abstract":[{"text":"Button is a UI element that triggers an action or event, and is used to initiate tasks or confirming an action.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Button appears in different layouts, styles and states to indicate hierarchy or emphasis.","type":"text"}],"title":"MISOButton","kind":"symbol"},"component_button_FoxyRough":{"type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/component_button_FoxyRough.png"}],"alt":"A button component in light and dark modes with FoxyRough theme","identifier":"component_button_FoxyRough"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","title":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection"}}}